WEBVTT

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:02.810
Please return that!

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:03.680
Cram it!

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:08.190
You think just 'cause you're rich, you get to show off with some 72 color pencil set?

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:09.790
But I...

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:10.920
Stop right there!

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:16.960
You've gotta be pretty low to gang up and bully a single girl!

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:21.530
Mana...

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:28.470
Today's tea is a first flush Darjeeling.

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:33.410
Served with a side of cherry jam to enjoy at your leisure.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:36.050
Don't mind if I do!

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.320
It's delicious!

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:41.220
It has that spring flavor, doesn't it?

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.920
This is no time to be drinking tea!

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:46.290
We've gotta find Lance, and fast!

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:47.830
Yeah, we get it.

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:50.330
So, what is it, Alice?

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:53.030
Didn't we have our monthly tea party last week?

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:54.970
You wanted to talk?

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:57.500
I did.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.470
Naturally, I wish to ask...

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:02.940
about the Precure.

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:13.180
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:15.650
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:18.520
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:20.560
Every day it sparkles

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:24.260
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:31.140
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:36.810
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:42.450
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:47.880
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:53.590
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:53.790 --> 00:02:02.470
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:04.130
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:06.540
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:09.380
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:12.170
What's more than just cute

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:16.040
is our promise between girls

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:22.080
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:27.990
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:37.640
So uh, Precure...

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:39.170
Why do you ask?

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:41.040
Sebastian.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:41.870
Right away.

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:51.250
Why, hello there. {alt text "Sup, bitches."}

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:52.350
La—

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:54.390
Lance?!

00:02:57.290 --> 00:03:02.390
I Must Refuse!

00:02:57.290 --> 00:03:02.390
I Must Refuse!

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:05.460
Lance, what the heck happened?

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:07.370
Well you see...

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:12.370
Hey, you two are still here?

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:16.610
The teachers already left.

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:18.440
So if you don't clean up in three minutes,

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:19.310
you'll get locked in.

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:20.250
Oh no!

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.250
Wait a second!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:37.800
Sharyl, Raquel,

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:40.330
where are you guys?

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:43.970
Don't leave me all alone, please...

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:52.540
Oh dear!

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:55.110
What shall we do?

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:57.320
Stay strong!

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:06.860
And that's the story!

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:08.590
You don't say...

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:10.700
You can't reveal the Precure's secret!

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:14.470
Don't get mad...

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:17.300
Lance is not the one you should blame.

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:18.500
Sebastian.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:19.340
Right away.

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:27.650
Precure Love Link!

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:37.090
I...

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:37.760
can explain...

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:41.260
This was taken from one of Clover Tower's security cameras.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:44.500
I was fortunate enough to delete it when I found it,

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:48.470
but you narrowly avoided making the Precures a household name.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:50.600
That'd be a huge problem!

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:52.240
Please, Alice!

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:54.270
You've gotta keep this a secret!

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:55.840
Be at ease.

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:59.010
None beside Madam and I know of this incident.

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:02.250
But we cannot lower our guard.

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:05.220
And so, I have a proposal.

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:06.720
A proposal?

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:11.290
Allow me to be your producer.

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:15.130
A third one?

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:17.030
Is that true, Ira?

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:19.730
Yep, they got another one.

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:22.170
She's all blue and floaty.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:23.840
And glittery, too!

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:25.040
Oh my,

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:26.100
Ira has a crush?

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:27.140
Like heck!

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:28.510
Then what?

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:33.140
You saw a new Precure and ran screaming?

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:36.380
I-I wouldn't be scared... of a hundred of 'em...

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:37.720
But didn't you lose?

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:38.880
Just shaddup!

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.350
But really,

00:05:40.350 --> 00:05:42.890
how many more Precures will there be?

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:44.490
It's <i>so</i> stressful.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:47.530
The sooner we destroy them, the better.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:51.500
Just like we did with Trump Kingdom.

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:55.100
Producer, huh?

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:56.570
What will you do?

00:05:56.940 --> 00:05:58.040
Well, I'll...

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:02.570
The dark heartbeat of a Selfish!

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:04.080
Huh? Where?

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:06.240
Oogai City's train station, it seems.

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:06.980
Huh?

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:08.450
You know?

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:09.110
Yes.

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:13.150
The Yotsuba's information networks are nothing to sneeze at.

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:14.220
Sebastian.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:15.150
Right away. {PRECUREMOBILE IS GO}

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:31.240
So, shall we make our leave?

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:36.110
Sound leeakaaaaaaaaaaaage! {Hey, high quality headphones do that.}

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:40.950
Good work, Selfish!

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:42.150
Stop right there!

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:51.820
Br-Brimming with love, Cure Heart!

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:54.560
The light of wisdom, Cure Diamond!

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:56.530
Are you okay?

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:57.660
Carsick...

00:06:58.960 --> 00:06:59.860
Selfish!

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:01.870
Max volume!

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:05.870
Do your best out there!

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:14.680
Great, Selfish! Get 'em!

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:18.680
They're fighting hard...

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:19.720
Now, Alice!

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:20.650
Let's transform too!

00:07:23.050 --> 00:07:24.690
Would you like more?

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:25.890
Thank you.

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:28.630
What are you doing!

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:30.930
We should fight, too!

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:32.700
There is no need to worry.

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:33.500
Besides...

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:36.100
the battle is already over.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:39.140
Selfiiiiish!

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:42.970
Selfy?

00:07:42.970 --> 00:07:43.710
What's up?

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:44.580
Why're you—

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.210
You're outta power?!

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:50.450
Now is your chance!

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:51.250
Heart!

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:51.920
Right!

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:01.690
From me to you,

00:08:01.690 --> 00:08:03.930
My Sweet Heart!

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:10.030
Love love looooove!

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:16.940
All video from the station's cameras have been deleted.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:21.980
All eyewitness accounts on the internet have also been deleted. {This is what Toei actually believes.}

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:23.410
Excellent work.

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:26.450
Your butler's amazing!

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:28.550
Oh, I'm nothing of the sort.

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:30.620
Well, that's that.

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:34.530
I plan to produce you by supporting you from the sidelines.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:36.790
Well, that's a big help...

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:37.830
Alice...

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:40.600
Lance?

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:43.300
Alice, why didn't you fight?

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:47.040
Mana and Rikka were fighting with all they had,

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:50.070
but you were sitting back and drinking tea! {Guilt tripping for that contract? Kyubei would be proud.}

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:52.180
It's not right!

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:53.510
Lance?

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:57.820
You should transform into a Precure and fight with them!

00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:00.020
The thought's nice, but...

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:03.090
Alice needs a Cure Lovies, right?

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:04.620
Cure Lovies?

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:05.560
Oh.

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:06.960
This.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:09.860
Without this, you can't transform.

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:11.560
Sebastian.

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:12.300
Right away.

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:15.030
A Cure Lovies!

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:15.970
How?

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:19.940
A jewelry stall owner in Clover Tower gave it to me.

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:21.570
That must be...

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.110
Then it's settled!

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:31.520
Alice, I came to this world to meet you!

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:33.320
Please!

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:37.060
Become a Precure and fight with me!

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:42.390
I apologize.

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:44.300
I...

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:47.200
will not become a Precure.

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:53.270
Alice, you poopyhead! {Her hair really does look like poop.}

00:09:53.270 --> 00:09:54.340
Lance!

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:56.540
Lance...

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:22.130
Why won't Alice become a Precure?

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:23.430
About that...

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:26.740
I think I have an idea.

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:27.640
Mana!

00:10:28.010 --> 00:10:29.610
An idea?

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:33.310
We all went to the same elementary school.

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:36.810
Girls as rich as Alice were pretty rare,

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:38.950
so she was picked on pretty often.

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:42.850
You two should be ashamed!

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:52.230
Though it wouldn't have mattered if it stopped there.

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:53.700
What happened?

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:55.270
Well, you see...

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:03.010
So you the punks that done gave my kid bros trouble?

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:04.910
I'll get a teacher!

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:05.680
Don't worry!

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:11.380
I'm no scaredy-cat, and I don't needs a grown-up to save me!

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:12.520
What'd you say?

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:13.420
Says you!

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:15.850
You're always butting in when nobody asks!

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:18.820
I bet you're just doin' it to show off!

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.890
What? Absolutely not!

00:11:20.890 --> 00:11:24.100
Y'know everyone says you're annoyin', right?

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:25.930
You're lying!

00:11:26.230 --> 00:11:28.030
Nuh-uh, she's an annoyin' showoff!

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:30.030
Buttin' in with her big butt!

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:31.770
No...

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:33.740
I'm not like that!

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:35.940
Not a bit!

00:11:42.150 --> 00:11:43.510
Aw, she's cryin'!

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:44.320
Yay!

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.290
Take back your words. {I like how this line comes at the end of the "Isn't it normal to help your friends" line from the OP that the piano is playing.}

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:49.020
Alice?

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:50.860
You say sumthin'?

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:55.930
You will take back your insults to Mana...

00:11:56.760 --> 00:11:58.230
right this instant!{Now I've lost it, I know I can kill.}

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:02.370
Alice got in a fight?

00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:04.770
So, what happened?

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:06.000
Well you see,

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:10.340
Alice learned a lot from her grandfather.

00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:12.980
Not just piano or calligraphy,

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:16.580
but karate, judo, kendo, aikido...

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:18.620
So then...

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:20.690
U...

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:22.520
Uncle...

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:29.590
Alice?

00:12:31.030 --> 00:12:32.030
Alice!

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:44.680
After that, Alice quit all of her martial arts.

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:49.150
When people made fun of her friends,

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:51.350
she lost control of herself.

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:54.020
She probably knows it full well.

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:57.990
So that has to be why she won't become a Precure...

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:01.330
A dark heartbeat!

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:02.730
Huh? Again?

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:03.800
Mana!

00:13:04.060 --> 00:13:04.800
Right!

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:07.130
Lance?

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:08.570
I'm...

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:12.200
I'm gonna talk to Alice one more time!

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:14.510
Gotcha.

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:15.710
Let's hurry!

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:28.190
Madam, it seems another Selfish has appeared.

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:29.750
Where are the others?

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:31.720
On the scene.

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:32.790
I see.

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:35.090
Are you certain?

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:37.260
I am only a producer.

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:40.670
I leave the real work in their hands.

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:48.210
Do you not wish to fight by their side?

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:48.870
Huh?

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:53.080
What I've noticed in my long life of service

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:59.520
is that you truly shine brightest when you are with those two.

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:05.060
Perhaps you should be more honest at times.

00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:07.490
I cannot.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:08.690
I am...

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:11.060
scared of it.

00:14:11.860 --> 00:14:14.330
I may lose my composure again,

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:16.800
and possibly wound someone deeply.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:21.210
In my hands, the Precure's power...

00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:23.470
is dangerous.

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:25.440
That's not true!

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:28.310
Lance!

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:32.820
The Precure's power is for protecting those you hold dear!

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:35.520
You shouldn't be afraid of it!

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:38.890
Alice.

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:41.090
I heard of what happened.

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:43.690
Grandfather!

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:49.970
Power is not meant for subduing your foes.

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:51.700
Reflect upon this.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:55.440
For what purpose do you clench your fists?

00:14:56.940 --> 00:15:01.080
Power is meant to protect those you love.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:05.180
So long as you remember this, you shall never be controlled by your power again.

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:07.890
Alice, fear not!

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:11.190
Improve yourself, and open your heart!

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:17.630
<i>Power is...</i>

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:22.900
<i>meant to protect those I hold dear!</i>

00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:29.070
Thank you, Lance.

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:33.380
I am no longer afraid!

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:37.650
Hey yo fool, betta listen to mah sound!

00:15:37.650 --> 00:15:40.220
I like my sandwiches stackin' by the pound, yeah!

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:45.120
It's a boombox this time?

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.260
What're those?

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:49.190
I'm kinda lost here, but let's go!

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:51.360
Sharyl!

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:56.270
Precure Love Link!

00:15:58.240 --> 00:15:58.970
L-O-V-E!

00:15:58.970 --> 00:15:59.670
L-O-V-E!

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:00.300
L-O-V-E!

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:01.340
L-O-V-E!

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:35.840
Brimming with love,

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:37.980
Cure Heart!

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:42.350
Raquel!

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:47.080
Precure Love Link!

00:16:48.390 --> 00:16:48.990
L-O-V-E!

00:16:48.990 --> 00:16:49.650
L-O-V-E!

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:50.390
L-O-V-E!

00:16:50.390 --> 00:16:51.360
L-O-V-E!

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:20.120
The light of wisdom,

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:22.550
Cure Diamond!

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:25.260
<i>There</i> you are.

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:27.990
Oh poor boombox who has forgotten love, {The JP here actually changed}

00:17:27.990 --> 00:17:29.330
I, Cure Heart—

00:17:30.530 --> 00:17:33.000
Hey, let me finish!

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:34.300
Can't stop mah swag!

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:37.500
We'll have to wait for his power to run out!

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:38.100
Right!

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:39.200
Morons!

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:40.810
Take a look at that!

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:44.840
A power cable?!

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:46.340
Hit 'em with full power!

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:47.180
Yeyah!

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:48.780
Catch them!

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:50.110
Catch dat heart!

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:52.980
Get paper!

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:55.720
Round 'n round,

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:57.250
y'all get around! {fuck him for actually using English on this line}

00:17:58.890 --> 00:17:59.560
Get away!

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:04.500
Finish them, Selfish!

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.160
Ain't no thang.

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:10.870
Stop, if you'd please.

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:15.940
Any further attacks on my dear friends...

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:19.780
will be punished!

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:21.280
Alice!

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:24.380
Now then, Lance.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:27.350
May I have your aid?

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:30.020
Of course!

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:32.690
Lance!

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:37.430
Precure Love Link!

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:39.400
L-O-V-E!

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:40.130
L-O-V-E!

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:40.800
L-O-V-E!

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:41.900
L-O-V-E!

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:12.060
The warmth of the sun,

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:14.470
Cure Rosetta!

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:20.200
The warmth of the sun?

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:21.610
Cure Rosetta!

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:23.010
<i>Another</i> one?!

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:26.080
Only love makes the world go round.

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:29.580
Now, you and I

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:31.950
will nurture that love!

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:33.220
Are you <i>kiddin'</i> me?!

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:34.750
Beat her up, Selfish!

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:35.790
Aww yeah.

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:52.700
Amazing.

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:54.170
This...

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:57.310
is the power to protect those I hold dear.

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:02.850
Rosetta!

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:05.920
Think you can jump in? My volume's bumpin'!

00:20:05.920 --> 00:20:08.150
Now eat mah bazooka, all day I'm pumpin'!

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:10.790
Lance!

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:18.960
Rigid Rosetta Wall!

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:22.600
Yo!

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:25.600
It blocked it?

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:26.470
Amazing!

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:28.840
But it's just a defense.

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:30.170
No.

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:32.680
Being defensive is what makes it such a powerful attack!

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:38.850
The sound disappeared!

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:40.020
Why?

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:42.220
I see, that was noise canceling!

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:43.420
Now!

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:47.190
Sharyl!

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:55.930
From me to you,

00:20:55.930 --> 00:20:58.200
My Sweet Heart!

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:04.510
Love love looove, yeah!

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:09.010
Curses! I'll remember this!

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:20.490
Huh?

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:22.260
Thanks, Alice!

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:25.460
You're the best partner I could ask for!

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:28.900
Good luck from now on.

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:32.140
Now we've got three Precures!

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:34.640
Four if you count Cure Sword.

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:36.170
Cure Sword?

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:38.410
There's one more Precure out there.

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:41.250
But we don't know if she's on our side.

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:43.010
If that's the case,

00:21:43.010 --> 00:21:44.720
I may have a lead.

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:46.180
Really?

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:52.390
The Clover Tower's hidden cameras filmed one more Precure-looking person.

00:21:52.390 --> 00:21:54.660
And that person...

00:21:55.630 --> 00:21:58.600
Ace Tea

00:21:55.630 --> 00:21:58.600
Ace Tea

